From 16aaa9134030a48f0a6c2c88e46978bb27ad5cfe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: eileenthg <40307498+eileenthg@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 01:37:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] Populate c:foods/raw_bacon and c:foods/cooked_bacon
 convention tags

Farmer's Delight declares these CommonTags.Items constants but ships no
json for them (same situation already fixed for chicken/beef/pork/mutton).
wrapped_cantaloupe's crafting recipe requires c:foods/cooked_bacon
directly, so without this it was a registered-but-uncraftable item in a
vanilla + Delightful + Farmer's Delight setup. Populated with FD's own
bacon/cooked_bacon items, same pattern as the existing meat tag fixes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
